<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-nanshi" book-id="b-nanshi-019" chapter-id="c-nanshi-019-xieyu-opening-rendered" source-id="s-nanshi-019-current-rendered-xieyu-opening">
  <p id="c-nanshi-019-xieyu-opening-rendered:p001" annotation-status="named_mentions_first_pass" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanshi-019-xieyu-opening-rendered:p001:m0001" ref="aa6_83c_juy_ABA">謝裕</persName>字<persName id="c-nanshi-019-xieyu-opening-rendered:p001:m0002" ref="aa6_83c_juy_ABA">景仁</persName>，<persName id="c-nanshi-019-xieyu-opening-rendered:p001:m0003" ref="aa6_83c_juy_AA">朗</persName>弟<persName id="c-nanshi-019-xieyu-opening-rendered:p001:m0004" ref="aa6_83c_juy_AB">允</persName>之子、而<persName id="c-nanshi-019-xieyu-opening-rendered:p001:m0005" ref="aa6_83c_juy_AAAA">晦</persName>從父也。名與<persName id="c-nanshi-019-xieyu-opening-rendered:p001:m0006" ref="3qs_nqa_ioa_AAA">宋武帝</persName>諱同，故以字行。<persName id="c-nanshi-019-xieyu-opening-rendered:p001:m0007" ref="aa6_83c_juy_AB">允</persName>字<persName id="c-nanshi-019-xieyu-opening-rendered:p001:m0008" ref="aa6_83c_juy_AB">令度</persName>，位宣城內史。<persName id="c-nanshi-019-xieyu-opening-rendered:p001:m0009" ref="aa6_83c_juy_ABA">景仁</persName>幼爲從祖<persName id="c-nanshi-019-xieyu-opening-rendered:p001:m0010" ref="aa6_83c_juy_B">安</persName>所知，始爲前軍行參軍，會稽王世子<persName id="c-nanshi-019-xieyu-opening-rendered:p001:m0011" ref="c03_362_4d7">元顯</persName>嬖人<persName id="c-nanshi-019-xieyu-opening-rendered:p001:m0012" ref="9l9_zra_gjs">張法順</persName>權傾一時，內外無不造門，唯<persName id="c-nanshi-019-xieyu-opening-rendered:p001:m0013" ref="aa6_83c_juy_ABA">景仁</persName>不至，年三十而方爲著作佐郎。<persName id="c-nanshi-019-xieyu-opening-rendered:p001:m0014" ref="u9s_w6j_8mc_AAF">桓玄</persName>誅<persName id="c-nanshi-019-xieyu-opening-rendered:p001:m0015" ref="c03_362_4d7">元顯</persName>，見<persName id="c-nanshi-019-xieyu-opening-rendered:p001:m0016" ref="aa6_83c_juy_ABA">景仁</persName>，謂四坐曰：「<rs id="c-nanshi-019-xieyu-opening-rendered:p001:m-group-117" type="unresolved">司馬庶人父子</rs>雲何不敗，遂令<persName id="c-nanshi-019-xieyu-opening-rendered:p001:m0017" ref="aa6_83c_juy_ABA">謝景仁</persName>三十而方佐著作郎。」<persName id="c-nanshi-019-xieyu-opening-rendered:p001:m0018" ref="u9s_w6j_8mc_AAF">玄</persName>建楚臺，以補黃門侍郎。及篡位，領驍騎將軍。</p>
</text>
